After recent performance fixes we are now not bound by CPU or disk IOPS. Apiserver during density test uses around 80% of CPU. Still we observe high request latency for pods, events, endpoints and sometimes other resources. I was able to narrow this down to slow etcd.

Etcd uses up to 80% of CPU. For some reason we see high latency of requests to etcd. Increasing disk (to increase IOPS) or number of cores doesn't help. In order to meet criteria defined in 1.0 roadmap (#4521) we have to make it much faster.

