Verb is not considered when authorizing a non-resource request, which means that any verb is allowed if a user has even read access to the given non-resource URL:

```
    if attr.IsResourceRequest() {
        requestedRule = rbac.PolicyRule{
            Verbs:         []string{attr.GetVerb()},
            APIGroups:     []string{attr.GetAPIGroup()},
            Resources:     []string{attr.GetResource()},
            ResourceNames: []string{attr.GetName()},
        }
    } else {
        requestedRule = rbac.PolicyRule{
            NonResourceURLs: []string{attr.GetPath()},
        }
    }
