I panic a little cause I thought I requested it. I look up a few things and in a lark rerun and kubectl get services get:
NAME         CLUSTER-IP       EXTERNAL-IP     PORT(S)   AGE
frontend     10.163.255.126   146.X.Y.Z   80/TCP    4m
